{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 143, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 144, "text": "// Answer 1 (What's wrong with you?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 145, "text": "،ﻢﯿﺘﺷﺍﺩ ﻪﮐ ﯽﺗﻼﮑﺸﻣ ﺰﺟ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 146, "text": ".ﻢﺑﻮﺧ ًﻼﻣﺎﮐ ﻦﻣ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 147, "text": "...ﻩﺩﺮﮐ ﺮﯿﯿﻐﺗ ﺍﺰﯿﭼ ﯽﻠﯿﺧ ﯽﻟﻭ ،ﻪﯿﻟﺎﻋ ﺰﯿﭼ ﻪﻤﻫ"}
